# Session 3: real third-party ontologies, fetched not committed.
# The whole folder used to be ignored, but the student's own deliverables
# (scro-extension.ttl, reasoned.ttl, report.tsv) also land in here, per
# session-03-ontology/README.md, and a blanket ignore silently dropped
# them too. Ignore the fetched third-party material by default, then
# explicitly un-ignore the three files a student is meant to commit.
session-03-ontology/workspace/*
!session-03-ontology/workspace/scro-extension.ttl
!session-03-ontology/workspace/reasoned.ttl
!session-03-ontology/workspace/report.tsv

# Generated graphs and reports, regenerate, do not commit
*.ttl.bak
profiling_report_*.html

